      },
      {
        "id": "b_4e2l6dyx",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The Shixun car is the student-facing chassis in the teaching line — docking and charge support for classroom fleets, and a clear platform for embedded / IoT exercises."
      },
      {
        "id": "b_xwx2q7v4",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "It sits beside the Zongheng robot as a separate product in the same education stack, not a single bundled unit."
      },
      {
        "id": "b_anzz256d",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "ZH_MCar controller"
      },
      {
        "id": "b_7zdz2rrv",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Mainboard for the training car — ESP32 wireless, DC12V in, USB-C, and four motor channels (A–D) for mecanum drive."
      },
      {
        "id": "b_gbaeq4v3",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Designed as the student-facing control board: bring-up, power, and motion on one PCB rather than a pile of modules."
      },
